{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zCy39tRySf1795757861.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本宇宙航空研究開發機構(JAXA)將與印度合作，進行月球極地探測任務(LUPEX)，在月球尋找水資源蹤跡。JAXA近日公開展示專為任務而設的月球探測車原型，並在東京測試。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"jaxa.moon.cover.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LCZmFTfvHW1795757918.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>四履帶設計　模擬月面環境進行測試</strong></p><p></p><p>片段可見，月球探測車具備四條履帶，在模擬月球表面凹凸不平的環境行走。JAXA指，月球探測車配備儀器探測可能含有水資源的位置，亦設有鑽頭鑽進月面並分析樣本。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"jaxa.moon.1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026T3nfdUn1mi1795757934.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這次日印攜手進行的月球探測任務，日本負責操作月球探測車，印度則負責製造及控制月球着陸器。月球探測車預計將於2028年，在鹿兒島縣種子島宇宙中心搭載H3火箭發射升空。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"jaxa.moon.2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sk6ui7CwBD1795757955.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T09:36:39.476335+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":264,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:53:27.661965+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T09:30:00.934294+00:00","content_hash":"fd155bace2bea0433d66b52da16d14e9c4f047b1624bdea1b0a8c127a04cec0e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}